    "title": "Financial Capability Academy - ENGLISH",
    "start": "2026-03-12T18:00:00-04:00",
    "end": "2026-03-12T20:00:00-04:00",
    "location": "City Hall - 515 North Avenue  New Rochelle NY 10801",
    "url": "/common/modules/iCalendar/iCalendar.aspx?feed=calendar&catID=90",
    "description": "The Financial Capability Academy is a FREE program that will offer four classes to help residents improve their finances, enabling them to live where and how they want to live in NR. It will allow someone to build their financial capabilities to move into affordable housing, to newly built housing developments, or to become a homeowner in New Rochelle.  https://www.newrochelleny.gov/calendar.aspx?EID=7122"
